#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Assessment"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Tests and examinations, who sat them, and their results."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Assessment instrument**: A versioned test or examination, with its items, scoring rules and proficiency thresholds. _Avoid_: Exam paper, test form"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Administration**: One sitting of an assessment instrument by a group of candidates on a date. _Avoid_: Sitting, session (unless that is the local term)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Candidate**: A learner entered for an administration. _Avoid_: Examinee, test taker"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Result**: A candidate's recorded outcome for an administration; once released, a change is a new version. _Avoid_: Score (unless it is a raw score), mark"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/assessment/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Accommodation**: An approved adjustment to how a candidate sits an administration. _Avoid_: Special arrangement, concession"
msgstr ""
